    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d330">

                <pb facs="0349" n="337" xml:id="pg337"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">761.6211/57: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Germany</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Kirk</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the
                            Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Berlin</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1939-08-21T00:00:00+01:00">August 21,
                            1939—midnight</date>.<lb/>[Received August 21—10:50 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>852. The German official telegraphic agency and the German radio system has just
                    announced that, “The German and Soviet Governments had agreed to conclude a
                    non-aggression pact with each other” and that “Ribbentrop would arrive in Moscow
                    on Wednesday, August 23, to conclude the negotiations”.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Kirk</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
